#!/usr/bin/env python3

"""
LOCAL RESEARCH INTELLIGENCE & AGENTIC RAG
=========================================

Pipeline
--------
PDFs
  ↓
PyMuPDF extraction
  ↓
Cleaning + paragraph-aware chunking
  ↓
Sentence Transformer embeddings
  ↓
FAISS vector database
  ↓
Semantic retrieval + keyword reranking
  ↓
Lightweight research-agent workflow
  ↓
Local LLM using Ollama
  ↓
Grounded answer + page-level citations

Features
--------
1. Ingest a directory of technical/research PDFs
2. Extract text page-by-page
3. Chunk text while preserving page metadata
4. Create normalized embeddings
5. Persist a FAISS index
6. Persist chunk metadata in JSON
7. Semantic search
8. Lightweight lexical reranking
9. Query expansion when retrieval is weak
10. Local LLM generation through Ollama
11. Source/page citations
12. Direct source inspection
13. SQLite library + query history
14. Interactive research mode
15. Retrieval evaluation using JSONL test cases

Example
-------
python local_research_intelligence.py ingest --docs ./documents

python local_research_intelligence.py ask \
    "What methodology does the paper use for noise analysis?"

python local_research_intelligence.py interactive

python local_research_intelligence.py inspect \
    --file paper.pdf \
    --page 4

python local_research_intelligence.py stats

python local_research_intelligence.py evaluate evaluation.jsonl

Requirements
------------
pip install -r requirements.txt

Ollama
------
Install Ollama and pull a local model, e.g.

    ollama pull llama3.2:3b

The model must be available locally through:

    http://127.0.0.1:11434
"""

